  ($d$google/learnlm-1.5-pro-experimental$d$::text, 'a4a5da149a52'::text, $d$LearnLM 1.5 Pro Experimental was an experimental Google model built on Gemini 1.5 Pro and fine-tuned for learning and tutoring use cases.$d$::text),
