  ($d$google/veo-3.1-preview$d$::text, '23f2b73d20f0'::text, $d$Veo 3.1 Preview was the preview of Veo 3.1, Google's high-quality video generation model for text-to-video, image-to-video, and first-and-last-frame workflows.$d$::text),
  ($d$gryphe/mythomax-l2-13b$d$::text, '27fe5cddeaba'::text, $d$MythoMax L2 13B is a Llama 2 13B merge by Gryphe that combines MythoLogic-L2 and Huginn, aimed at creative writing and roleplay.$d$::text),
  ($d$ibm/granite-3.2-8b-instruct-preview$d$::text, 'f61fafb5a4fb'::text, $d$Granite 3.2 8B Instruct Preview is an early preview of IBM's Granite 3.2 8B Instruct language model, released ahead of the Granite 3.2 family.$d$::text),
  ($d$ibm/granite-4.0-h-micro$d$::text, 'cf3d3ab50a50'::text, $d$Granite 4.0 H Micro is a 3B-parameter model from IBM's Granite 4.0 family. It is a smaller-footprint option suited to tighter latency or deployment budgets.$d$::text),
  ($d$ibm/granite-4.0-tiny-preview$d$::text, 'ddc2862a7d92'::text, $d$Granite 4.0 Tiny Preview is an early preview of IBM's Granite 4.0 Tiny language model, released in May 2025 ahead of the Granite 4.0 family.$d$::text),
  ($d$ibm/granite-vision-3.1-2b-preview$d$::text, 'ef581cf47a7f'::text, $d$Granite Vision 3.1 2B Preview is an early preview of IBM's compact vision-language model for visual document understanding.$d$::text),
  ($d$inflection/pi-3.1-preview$d$::text, '07aa50fa8ecf'::text, $d$Pi 3.1 Preview is a preview of Inflection's model behind the Pi chatbot, tuned for emotional intelligence, backstory and safety.$d$::text),
  ($d$kblab/kb-whisper-large$d$::text, 'bdd35489d6bd'::text, $d$KB-Whisper Large is KBLab's Swedish speech recognition model, fine-tuned from OpenAI's Whisper Large for transcription.$d$::text),
  ($d$kling/kling-3-turbo$d$::text, '6239a1fd95b7'::text, $d$Kling 3.0 Turbo is Kuaishou's speed-optimized Kling 3.0 video model for text-to-video and image-to-video with native audio, multi-shot storyboarding of up to six shots, and 720p or 1080p clips of 3 to 15 seconds.$d$::text),
  ($d$kling/kling-v3.0-4k$d$::text, '3a291da6ba38'::text, $d$Kling Video 3.0 4K is Kuaishou's Kling 3.0 video model for native 4K text-to-video and image-to-video generation.$d$::text),
  ($d$kling/kling-v3.0-pro$d$::text, '92398623b483'::text, $d$Kling v3.0 Pro is Kuaishou's premium video generation model, offering higher visual quality than the Standard tier. It supports text-to-video and image-to-video workflows, with first-frame and last-frame control.$d$::text),
  ($d$kling/kling-v3.0-std$d$::text, '18f094bd68c9'::text, $d$Kling v3.0 Standard is a video generation model from Kuaishou. It supports text-to-video and image-to-video workflows, with first-frame and last-frame control for guided scene composition.$d$::text),
  ($d$krea/k3-edit$d$::text, '3d55e39980af'::text, $d$K3 Edit is Krea's image editing model, accepting up to four reference images and a text instruction.$d$::text),
  ($d$kwaipilot/kat-coder-exp-72b-1010$d$::text, '18656c18dc18'::text, $d$Kat Coder Exp 72B (1010) is an experimental model in KwaiKAT's KAT-Coder series, designed for complex software engineering tasks.$d$::text),
  ($d$kwaipilot/kat-coder-pro-v2$d$::text, 'fc28a5062b47'::text, $d$Kat Coder Pro V2 is a high-performance model in KwaiKAT's KAT-Coder series, designed for complex enterprise-grade software engineering and SaaS integration.$d$::text),
  ($d$lightricks/ltx-2-fast$d$::text, '32354e55d4da'::text, $d$LTX-2 Fast was Lightricks' fast LTX-2 video generation model with synchronized audio, later replaced by LTX-2.3.$d$::text),
  ($d$lightricks/ltx-2-pro$d$::text, 'a49251cda2f5'::text, $d$LTX-2 Pro was Lightricks' high-fidelity LTX-2 video generation model with synchronized audio, later replaced by LTX-2.3.$d$::text),
  ($d$liquid-ai/d1.1$d$::text, '14041d353e94'::text, $d$Liquid AI hosted decision model for classification, routing and scoring from text and images. Returns yes/no, choice and score probabilities without generating tokens.$d$::text),
  ($d$liquid-ai/lfm-2.5-2.6b$d$::text, '9cd43b557fe7'::text, $d$LFM2.5-2.6B is a compact reasoning model from Liquid AI. It is suited for agent workflows, data extraction, RAG, and long-context processing.$d$::text),
  ($d$mancer/weaver$d$::text, '027ef438f122'::text, $d$Weaver is a Mancer model for roleplay and narrative writing, tuned for verbose responses.$d$::text),
  ($d$medaibase/antangelmed$d$::text, 'cf718227c39a'::text, $d$AntAngelMed is an open-weight language model for medical question answering.$d$::text),
  ($d$meta/llama-3.1-70b-instruct$d$::text, '35a074ed6321'::text, $d$Meta's Llama 3.1 class of model, launched in July 2024 with a variety of sizes and flavors. This 70B instruct-tuned version is optimized for high-quality dialogue use cases.$d$::text),
  ($d$meta/llama-3.2-1b-instruct$d$::text, '181019bfb930'::text, $d$Llama 3.2 1B is a 1-billion-parameter language model focused on efficiently performing natural language tasks, such as summarization, dialogue, and multilingual text analysis.$d$::text),
  ($d$meta/llama-3.2-3b-instruct$d$::text, 'b5a30326d73f'::text, $d$Llama 3.2 3B is a 3-billion-parameter multilingual large language model, optimized for natural language processing tasks like dialogue generation, reasoning, and summarization.$d$::text),
  ($d$meta/muse-spark-open:free$d$::text, '6df7fccc070f'::text, $d$Muse Spark Open (Free) was a limited-time free offer of Meta's open-weight Muse Spark Open model, which ended on October 18, 2026.$d$::text),
  ($d$microsoft/wizardlm-2-8x22b$d$::text, '8d17d1484c0a'::text, $d$WizardLM-2 8x22B is the largest WizardLM-2 model from Microsoft AI, a mixture-of-experts model fine-tuned from Mixtral 8x22B.$d$::text),
  ($d$minimax/minimax-01$d$::text, 'c0c7eff5059a'::text, $d$MiniMax-01 combines MiniMax-Text-01 for text generation and MiniMax-VL-01 for image understanding. It has 456 billion parameters, with 45.9 billion activated per inference.$d$::text),
  ($d$minimax/minimax-h3-max$d$::text, 'f70f82aaddf4'::text, $d$MiniMax H3 Max is a fast video generation variant post-trained on MiniMax H3. It supports text-to-video and image-to-video generation at 480P or 768P for 5-15 second videos.$d$::text),
  ($d$minimax/minimax-m1$d$::text, 'fb20b2ed711e'::text, $d$MiniMax-M1 is a large-scale, open-weight reasoning model designed for extended context and high-efficiency inference. It uses a hybrid Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture paired with a custom lightning attention mechanism.$d$::text),
  ($d$minimax/minimax-m2.1$d$::text, '1ffd8433e6d8'::text, $d$MiniMax M2.1 is a lightweight large language model from MiniMax optimized for coding, agentic workflows, and modern application development.$d$::text),
  ($d$minimax/minimax-m2.5$d$::text, 'e4e1faa11463'::text, $d$MiniMax M2.5 is a large language model from MiniMax designed for real-world productivity. It supports up to 204.8K of input context for long documents, codebases, and agent workflows.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/codestral-2508$d$::text, '3ba2845b7d4d'::text, $d$Codestral 25.08 is Mistral's coding model released at the end of July 2025. It specializes in low-latency, high-frequency tasks such as fill-in-the-middle (FIM), code correction and test generation.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/ministral-14b$d$::text, '81fde1607cd6'::text, $d$Ministral 14B is the largest model in Mistral's Ministral 3 family of compact models, with text and image input.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/ministral-14b-2512$d$::text, '399102930702'::text, $d$Ministral 3 14B is the largest model in Mistral's Ministral 3 family, with performance Mistral reports as comparable to the larger Mistral Small 3.2 24B.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/ministral-3-14b$d$::text, '39af49051535'::text, $d$Ministral 3 14B Instruct is the largest model in Mistral's Ministral 3 family of compact models.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mistral-large-2407$d$::text, 'eb2f581a1805'::text, $d$Mistral Large 2 (version mistral-large-2407) is Mistral AI's weights-available large model for reasoning, code, JSON output and chat.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mistral-medium-3$d$::text, '46bc55b5ff1b'::text, $d$Mistral Medium 3 is an enterprise-grade multimodal language model from Mistral, designed to deliver strong reasoning and multimodal performance at reduced operational cost.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mistral-small-24b-instruct-2501$d$::text, '269230b8836a'::text, $d$Mistral Small 3 is a 24B-parameter language model optimized for low-latency performance across common AI tasks. Released under the Apache 2.0 license, it has both pre-trained and instruction-tuned versions.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mistral-small-2503$d$::text, '601285217196'::text, $d$Mistral Small 3.1 (2503) is a 24-billion-parameter multimodal model from Mistral AI that processes text and image inputs, built for fast-response agents, long-context processing, function calling and local deployment.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mistral-small-3.1-24b-instruct$d$::text, 'b0dfa9d45f07'::text, $d$Mistral Small 3.1 24B Instruct is an upgraded variant of Mistral Small 3 (2501), with 24 billion parameters and image understanding.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct$d$::text, '68e96093ebab'::text, $d$Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506 is an updated 24B parameter model from Mistral optimized for instruction following, repetition reduction, and improved function calling.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/mixtral-8x22b-instruct$d$::text, '31aaba734a3d'::text, $d$Mixtral 8x22B Instruct is Mistral's official instruction-tuned version of Mixtral 8x22B, a sparse mixture-of-experts model that uses 39B active parameters out of 141B.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/open-mistral-7b$d$::text, 'd93baaea14c5'::text, $d$Open Mistral 7B (officially Mistral 7B) is a 7.3-billion-parameter open-weight language model released by Mistral AI in September 2023, small enough to run on consumer hardware.$d$::text),
  ($d$mistral/voxtral-small-24b-2507$d$::text, '23065ea71a72'::text, $d$Voxtral Small is an enhancement of Mistral Small 3 that adds audio input while retaining its text performance. It handles speech transcription, translation and audio understanding.$d$::text),
  ($d$moonshotai/kimi-k2-0905$d$::text, '5795cb9619b6'::text, $d$Kimi K2 0905 is the September 2025 update of Moonshot AI's Kimi K2, a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) language model with 1 trillion total parameters and 32 billion active per forward pass.$d$::text),
  ($d$moonshotai/kimi-k2-thinking$d$::text, '28261714669c'::text, $d$Kimi K2 Thinking was Moonshot AI's open reasoning model released in November 2025, extending the K2 series into agentic, long-horizon reasoning. It accepts text inputs and produces text outputs.$d$::text),
  ($d$moonshotai/kimi-k2.6-code-preview$d$::text, 'cfa1cf2926ad'::text, $d$Kimi K2.6 Code Preview is a preview coding model from Moonshot AI for code generation, edits, and software tasks.$d$::text),
  ($d$moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code$d$::text, '9eb341f7116c'::text, $d$Kimi K2.7 Code is Moonshot AI's coding model built for long-context software engineering and agent workflows, with native text, image, and video input plus always-on long thinking.$d$::text),
  ($d$moonshotai/kimi-k3-fast$d$::text, 'e858f6212b4f'::text, $d$Kimi K3 Fast is a higher-throughput serving variant of Moonshot AI's Kimi K3.$d$::text),
  ($d$nousresearch/hermes-3-llama-3.1-405b$d$::text, 'e9cf1862fea6'::text, $d$Hermes 3 is a generalist language model from Nous Research with many improvements over Hermes 2, including advanced agentic capabilities, better roleplaying, reasoning, multi-turn conversation, and long-context coherence.$d$::text),
  ($d$nousresearch/hermes-3-llama-3.1-70b$d$::text, '40a1a84396c7'::text, $d$Hermes 3 is a generalist language model from Nous Research with many improvements over Hermes 2, including advanced agentic capabilities, better roleplaying, reasoning, multi-turn conversation, and long-context coherence.$d$::text),
  ($d$nousresearch/hermes-4-405b$d$::text, '2ad5f8956589'::text, $d$Hermes 4 is a large-scale reasoning model built on Meta-Llama-3.1-405B and released by Nous Research. It introduces a hybrid reasoning mode, where the model can choose to deliberate internally before answering.$d$::text),
  ($d$nousresearch/hermes-4-70b$d$::text, 'a050572b8ae8'::text, $d$Hermes 4 70B is a hybrid reasoning model from Nous Research, built on Meta-Llama-3.1-70B, that can either answer directly or deliberate before answering.$d$::text),
  ($d$nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b$d$::text, 'fd982052b0ad'::text, $d$Nemotron 3 Nano 30B A3B is NVIDIA's small open mixture-of-experts language model with about 3B active parameters, built for efficient, specialized agentic AI systems.$d$::text),
  ($d$nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni$d$::text, '124a47046a00'::text, $d$Nemotron 3 Nano Omni is NVIDIA's open multimodal Nemotron 3 Nano model for perception and context tasks in agent systems.$d$::text),
  ($d$nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b$d$::text, '77f7a149449c'::text, $d$Nemotron 3 Super is NVIDIA's 120B-parameter open hybrid MoE model with 12B active parameters, built for complex multi-agent applications.$d$::text),
  ($d$nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-nvfp4$d$::text, 'aad9b8ac33c7'::text, $d$Nemotron 3 Ultra NVFP4 is NVIDIA's 550B-parameter Nemotron 3 Ultra model (55B active) trained with an NVFP4 recipe, a hybrid LatentMoE model with interleaved Mamba-2, MoE and attention layers and multi-token prediction, built for agentic, reasoning and long-context work.$d$::text),
  ($d$nvidia/nemotron-3-voicechat$d$::text, 'ad1ea66c7b5c'::text, $d$Nemotron 3 VoiceChat is NVIDIA's 12B full-duplex speech-to-speech model for spoken conversations with audio and text interaction.$d$::text),
  ($d$nvidia/nvidia-nemotron-3-ultra$d$::text, '262fdd9f316d'::text, $d$NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra is NVIDIA's largest open-weights Nemotron 3 reasoning model, a 550B-parameter hybrid mixture-of-experts model with 55B active parameters.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/computer-use-preview$d$::text, 'ad56ab79bb2e'::text, $d$Computer Use Preview was OpenAI's model for the computer use tool, which reads screenshots and returns mouse and keyboard actions to operate a computer interface.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-3.5-turbo$d$::text, '42b3292e85e7'::text, $d$GPT-3.5 Turbo was OpenAI's fast, low-cost model for chat and traditional completion tasks in natural language or code. Training data up to Sep 2021.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-3.5-turbo-0613$d$::text, '302ead57af7c'::text, $d$GPT 3.5 Turbo 0613 was a June 2023 snapshot of OpenAI's GPT-3.5 Turbo, a fast, low-cost model for chat and traditional completion tasks in natural language or code. Training data up to Sep 2021.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-3.5-turbo-2023-11-06$d$::text, '114d0291c7b6'::text, $d$GPT 3.5 Turbo (2023-11-06) was a November 2023 snapshot of OpenAI's GPT-3.5 Turbo, a fast, low-cost model for chat and traditional completion tasks in natural language or code. Training data up to Sep 2021.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-3.5-turbo-2024-01-25$d$::text, '3dc83370bc4d'::text, $d$GPT 3.5 Turbo (2024-01-25) was a January 2024 snapshot of OpenAI's GPT-3.5 Turbo, a fast, low-cost model for chat and traditional completion tasks in natural language or code. Training data up to Sep 2021.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4-turbo-preview$d$::text, '46874fe1965c'::text, $d$GPT-4 Turbo Preview was OpenAI's preview GPT-4 Turbo model with improved instruction following, JSON mode, reproducible outputs, and parallel function calling. Training data: up to Dec 2023.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4o$d$::text, 'b57d66625d13'::text, $d$GPT 4o (2024-11-20) is an OpenAI model released in November 2024, supporting both text and image inputs with text outputs.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4o-2024-08-06$d$::text, '5ababf0ab410'::text, $d$The 2024-08-06 version of GPT-4o offers improved performance in structured outputs, with the ability to supply a JSON schema in the response_format.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4o-2024-11-20$d$::text, 'd34b8a59dfd3'::text, $d$The 2024-11-20 version of GPT-4o offers improved creative writing, with more natural, engaging, and tailored writing to improve relevance and readability.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18$d$::text, 'ff8e7fb24a78'::text, $d$GPT-4o mini is OpenAI's small, low-cost GPT-4o model, released in July 2024, supporting both text and image inputs with text outputs.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4o-mini-search-preview$d$::text, 'd4bdb78801c4'::text, $d$GPT 4o Mini Search Preview was a specialized OpenAI model for web search in Chat Completions, trained to understand and execute web search queries.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-4o-search-preview$d$::text, '9a6e34796590'::text, $d$GPT 4o Search Preview was a specialized OpenAI model for web search in Chat Completions, trained to understand and execute web search queries.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-5$d$::text, 'f00d8cbc4aa1'::text, $d$GPT 5 is OpenAI's GPT-5 model, released in August 2025 with major improvements in reasoning, code quality, and user experience over earlier OpenAI models. It supports up to 400K of input context for long documents, codebases, and agent workflows.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-5-image$d$::text, '04c9eec2bc9d'::text, $d$GPT-5 Image combines OpenAI's GPT-5 model with GPT Image 1 image generation, so a single model can reason over text and images and generate or edit images.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-5-image-mini$d$::text, '50aa04573302'::text, $d$GPT-5 Image Mini combines OpenAI's GPT-5 Mini with GPT Image 1 Mini for efficient image generation and editing alongside text responses.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-5-pro$d$::text, '19f434923159'::text, $d$GPT 5 Pro is the Pro-tier version of OpenAI's GPT-5, released in August 2025, which uses more compute to think longer on hard problems. It targets higher-capability workloads where depth, quality, or scale matter more than raw speed.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-5.2$d$::text, '958d40c043a7'::text, $d$GPT 5.2 is a frontier-grade model in the GPT-5 series released in December 2025, offering stronger agentic and long-context performance compared to GPT-5.1. It accepts text and image inputs and produces text outputs.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-5.3-codex$d$::text, '7562d35ae4a0'::text, $d$GPT 5.3 Codex is an OpenAI agentic coding model, released in February 2026, combining the software engineering performance of GPT-5.2-Codex with the broader reasoning and professional knowledge of GPT-5.2.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/gpt-6-luna$d$::text, 'd47c12deebca'::text, $d$GPT-6 Luna is OpenAI's most efficient GPT-6 model for focused, high-volume tasks.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/o1-preview$d$::text, '1b902b070ba6'::text, $d$o1 preview was the first preview of OpenAI's o1 reasoning model, released in September 2024, which spends more time thinking before responding.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/o3$d$::text, '0a9dfd833524'::text, $d$o3 is OpenAI's reasoning model for math, science, coding, and visual reasoning tasks, released in April 2025. It supports up to 200K of input context for long documents, codebases, and agent workflows.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/o3-mini-high$d$::text, '641b3ac93b17'::text, $d$OpenAI o3-mini-high is the same model as [o3-mini](/openai/o3-mini) with reasoning_effort set to high. o3-mini is a cost-efficient language model optimized for STEM reasoning tasks.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/o4-mini-deep-research$d$::text, '3ca710635316'::text, $d$o4 mini Deep Research is OpenAI's faster, more affordable deep research model for complex, multi-step research tasks. Note: This model always uses the 'web_search' tool which adds additional cost.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/o4-mini-high$d$::text, '9758aa6584b2'::text, $d$OpenAI o4-mini-high is the same model as [o4-mini](/openai/o4-mini) with reasoning_effort set to high. OpenAI o4-mini is a compact reasoning model in the o-series, optimized for fast, cost-efficient performance.$d$::text),
  ($d$openai/sora-2-pro$d$::text, '64a25f6fc45b'::text, $d$Sora 2 Pro was OpenAI's higher-quality Sora 2 video generation model, producing video with synchronized audio for production use.$d$::text),
  ($d$opencompass/compassjudger-1-32b-instruct$d$::text, 'e2ddf6aafe90'::text, $d$CompassJudger-1 32B Instruct is an open-weight judge model from OpenCompass for evaluating and scoring model responses.$d$::text),
  ($d$orcarouter/dub$d$::text, 'de927dbac705'::text, $d$OrcaDub 1.0 is an end-to-end, prosody-aware dubbing and video-translation model. Given a source video, it produces a dubbed video in a target language in the original speakers' cloned voices, preserving delivery and word-level timing across 28 languages.$d$::text),
  ($d$ornith/ornith-1.5-35b$d$::text, '8d2b27ccc9ee'::text, $d$Ornith 1.5 35B A3B is an open-weight multimodal mixture-of-experts model with text and image input, tool calling, JSON mode, and a 262,144-token context window.$d$::text),
  ($d$perplexity/sonar-deep-research$d$::text, '580cbadc7eea'::text, $d$Sonar Deep Research is a research-focused model designed for multi-step retrieval, synthesis, and reasoning across complex topics. It autonomously searches, reads, and evaluates sources.$d$::text),
  ($d$perplexity/sonar-pro-search$d$::text, '754da3b286ed'::text, $d$Sonar Pro Search is the Pro Search mode of Perplexity's Sonar Pro, an agentic search system designed for deeper multi-step reasoning and analysis.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qvq-72b-preview$d$::text, 'a19133418b77'::text, $d$QvQ 72B Preview was an experimental open-weight visual reasoning model from the Qwen team, released in December 2024.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen-2.5-7b-instruct$d$::text, 'ac9460848989'::text, $d$Qwen2.5 7B Instruct is a 7B instruction-tuned model from the Qwen2.5 series, which improves on Qwen2 with more knowledge and stronger coding and math.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-0.5b$d$::text, '3a761f7cbb0e'::text, $d$Qwen 2 0.5B is the smallest model in the Qwen team's Qwen2 series of large language models, released in June 2024.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-1.5b$d$::text, 'dc13b0923c07'::text, $d$Qwen 2 1.5B is a model in the Qwen team's Qwen2 series of large language models, released in June 2024.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-72b$d$::text, 'e6f8c0e9b342'::text, $d$Qwen 2 72B Instruct is the largest instruction-tuned model in the Qwen team's Qwen2 series of large language models, released in June 2024.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-7b$d$::text, '144f2eb1ea98'::text, $d$Qwen 2 7B Instruct is an instruction-tuned model in the Qwen team's Qwen2 series of large language models, released in June 2024.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-audio-7b$d$::text, '08191993dc02'::text, $d$Qwen 2 Audio 7B is the Qwen team's audio-language model, which accepts audio and text input for voice chat and audio analysis.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-math-1.5b$d$::text, 'fb01b646d6b8'::text, $d$Qwen 2 Math 1.5B is a math-specialized model from the Qwen team's Qwen2 series.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-math-72b$d$::text, 'b9f058b3fe65'::text, $d$Qwen 2 Math 72B is the largest math-specialized model from the Qwen team's Qwen2 series.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen2-math-7b$d$::text, 'f9c895569621'::text, $d$Qwen 2 Math 7B is a math-specialized model from the Qwen team's Qwen2 series.$d$::text),
